# The required check runs on Windows too. Sources are kept LF there: gofmt
# writes LF and lists any Go file that is not, and the tests read the other
# sources as text and match them line by line.
* text=auto
*.go text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
